{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216160","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321616001:0":{"text":"이... 이건 크세니아 아주머니의 무덤 아닌가요?!","source_cn":"这……这不是克谢尼娅大婶的墓吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182C238AE104CE59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321616002:1":{"text":"크세니아 아주머니께 아들, 딸이 있었던 걸로 기억해요. 오빠와 여동생이었죠. 아주머니의 아들은 여동생을 구하기 위해 살아있는 시체에게 목숨을 잃었고요...","source_cn":"我记得，克谢尼娅大婶有一对儿女，也是哥哥和妹妹。而且她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7455E71EA119A386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321616003:0":{"text":"우리가 데미를 만난 곳에서 종종 살아있는 시체가 나타나...","source_cn":"而我们遇到德米的地方，经常有活死人出没……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C5E74D34A24BB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1321616003":{"text":"우리가 데미를 만난 곳에서 종종 살아있는 시체가 나타나...","source_cn":"而我们遇到德米的地方，经常有活死人出没……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C5E74D34A24BB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321616004:1":{"text":"맞아... 어머니의 이름... 크세니아...","source_cn":"是的……我母亲的名字……克谢尼娅……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF632E6172F5C50ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아... 어머니의 이름... 크세니아...","female":"맞아... 어머니의 이름... 크세니아...","variant_male_record_index":"147319","variant_female_record_index":"147320","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321616005:0":{"text":"어머니의 생일에... 나랑 조아는 선물을 살 돈이 없어서... 앰버 후르츠를 따러 갈 수밖에 없었어...","source_cn":"母亲的生日……我和佐娅，买不起礼物……只能去采雾澄果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FE5C0751ECBCDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321616006:0":{"text":"...그러다 살아있는 시체를 만났고, 여동생인 조아를 보호하기 위해 살아있는 시체를 막은 거예요. 결국... 지금 이 모습이 되었고...","source_cn":"……然后，你们就遇到了活死人。为了保护妹妹佐娅，你选择...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0358DEEB3AB10E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321616007:0":{"text":"그런가... 기억이 잘 안 나...","source_cn":"是吗……我不记得了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC537A3A2A0073B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321616008:1":{"text":"이건 당신의 어머니께서 말씀해 주신 거예요.","source_cn":"这些是你母亲告诉我们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE24109A93E73EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321616009:0":{"text":"제 생각엔 당신이 목숨을 잃었던 경험 때문에 살아있는 시체가 아이를 노릴 때마다 망설임 없이 나서서 그들을 보호하는 집념이 생긴 것 같아요...","source_cn":"我想，也是因为你死前的经历，让你产生了执念，每次看到被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x889B33B24C235583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321616010:0":{"text":"사실 크세니아 아주머니도 데미처럼... 강한 집념을 가지고 계셨어요. 그 집념은 세상을 떠나기 전까지도 사라지지 않았죠...","source_cn":"其实克谢尼娅大婶也和德米一样……她也有很强的执念，而且...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9BCA90551443FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321616011:1":{"text":"맞아요... 데미, 아주머니께서는 당신이 돌아오길 기다리고 계셨어요.","source_cn":"没错……德米，她一直在等你回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CF2BF256F6CBA66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321616012:1":{"text":"내가... 돌아오길... 어머니... 저, 제가 돌아왔어요...","source_cn":"等我……回来……母亲……我，回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7536FF1E29FF3AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321616013:0":{"text":"...죄송해요, 어머니... 이렇게나 오래 떠나있었다니...","source_cn":"……对不起，母亲……我居然离开了这么久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBBA1F36CC9F3866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1321616013":{"text":"...죄송해요, 어머니... 이렇게나 오래 떠나있었다니...","source_cn":"……对不起，母亲……我居然离开了这么久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBBA1F36CC9F3866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321616014:0":{"text":"...참, <style=\"highlight\">앰버 후르츠</style>... 어머니께 드릴 생일 선물을...! 가, 가져오지 못했어...!","source_cn":"……对了，<style=highlight>雾澄果</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF659C1CB8A583E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321616015:0":{"text":"다... 다시 돌아가야 해...","source_cn":"我……我得再去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x477B69471881780B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321616016:0":{"text":"잠깐! 그곳엔 더 이상 가지 마요! 이 일은 우리가 처리할게요!","source_cn":"——停！你别再离开这里了！这件事交给我们来做就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF46294EF7961B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321616017:0":{"text":"치피는 당신이 또 기억을 잃고 돌아오는 길을 찾지 못할까 봐 걱정되니까...","source_cn":"要不然的话，满满真怕你又失去记忆，找不到回来的路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08FD53C6A602E67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321616018:0":{"text":"고마워... 정말 고마워...","source_cn":"谢谢……谢谢你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12E2C28ADF014D72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_